== Trivia ==
* Flip's icons are the alchemy symbols for death and life, respectively.
* Prior to patch [[V1.7.6]], Flip's pickup quote was "Life and death".
* Prior to patch V1.7.6, using Flip as a character other than Tainted Lazarus after having previously used {{i|Esau Jr.}} would switch between Esau Jr. and the base character. This was most likely a bug, as Flip was not yet obtainable for other characters besides using {{i|Death Certificate}} or as a starting item for {{c|Eden}}.

